# 🪨 Rock Paper Scissors Lizard Spock 🦎

A modern take on the classic **Rock Paper Scissors** game, expanded with two additional choices: **Lizard** and **Spock**.

Built as an interactive web game with animated UI, player feedback, and a simple, responsive design.

## 🎮 How to Play

Choose one of the five options:

- 🪨 **Rock**
- 📄 **Paper**
- ✂️ **Scissors**
- 🦎 **Lizard**
- 🖖 **Spock**

Each choice beats two other choices:

| Choice      | Beats            |
| ----------- | ---------------- |
| 🪨 Rock     | Scissors, Lizard |
| 📄 Paper    | Rock, Spock      |
| ✂️ Scissors | Paper, Lizard    |
| 🦎 Lizard   | Spock, Paper     |
| 🖖 Spock    | Scissors, Rock   |

The winner is determined once both the player and computer have selected their choices.

### Example

> Spock **vaporizes** Rock
> Rock **crushes** Lizard
> Lizard **eats** Paper
> Paper **covers** Rock
> Scissors **cuts** Paper

And so on!

## ✨ Features

- 🎮 Five-choice Rock Paper Scissors game
- 🤖 Computer-controlled opponent
- 🏆 Win, lose, and draw detection
- 📊 Score tracking
- 🎬 Animated game transitions
- 💫 Interactive UI feedback
- 📱 Responsive layout
- 🔄 Ability to play multiple rounds

## 🛠️ Built With

- **React**
- **JavaScript**
- **Framer Motion**
- **SCSS / CSS**
- **HTML**

## 🚀 Getting Started

### Prerequisites

You'll need **Node.js** and **npm** installed on your machine.

### Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/rock-paper-scissors-lizard-spock.git
```

Navigate into the project:

```bash
cd rock-paper-scissors-lizard-spock
```

Install the dependencies:

```bash
npm install
```

Start the development server:

```bash
npm start
```

The game should now be running locally.

